source="/var/log/auth.log" "Failed password"
| rex field=_raw "from\s(?<src_ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)"
| stats count dc(User) as unique_users min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by src_ip
| where count > 5
| sort -count
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
SSH Brute Force Detection
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1110.001 (Brute Force: Password Guessing)

Aggregates failed SSH password attempts by source IP.
Threshold of 5 failures catches most brute force
patterns while avoiding single-typo false positives.
```
